README
Week 10 · Class 5 · Student Capstone
Independent assessment, not a teaching session.
Read 01_Capstone_Project_Brief.docx and 02_Student_Execution_Guide.docx.
Set up: python -m pip install -r requirements.txt.
Implement src/production_pipeline.py and add tests.
Execute and document notebook/Week10_Class5_Student_Capstone.ipynb.
Generate outputs: cleaned_production.csv, data_quality_report.csv, daily_production_summary.csv, rejected_source_records.csv.
Submit a PR on your own GitHub repo using feature/week10-class05-capstone.
Dataset: synthetic training data only; no real field readings.

